# Build artifacts
*.o
HistoricRallyMeter
HistoricRallyMeter_debug
run_tests
i2c_error_test
test_rally_config.json

# IDE files
*.swp
*~

# Config files with runtime data (not secrets, but user-specific)
rally_config.json

# Sandbox run debris. The Docker box-display sandbox mounts this tree at
# /build and writes into it as it runs, so these appear in `git status` after
# any scripts/run-box.sh session. They were swept into a pull request once by
# a `git add -A`; the PulseAudio cookie under .config/ is the reason that
# matters more than the clutter does.
app.log
box_display.sh
.config/

# Screenshots taken while verifying behaviour on the sandbox box. The two
# .png files upstream ships (gaugepilot-rallymaster-display.png and
# historic_rally_meter_icon.png) are tracked and unaffected by these.
box_screenshot.png
copilot.png
frame.png
phone_qr.png
sim_check.png

# Per-page previews of the user manual. Each page is rendered on its own as
# docs/_preview-<page>.html while it is being reviewed at print size, then
# thrown away; they are regenerated on demand and nothing references them.
# One (_preview-datetime.html) was swept in by a `git add` during RB-DTM-02
# and reached PR #44 before it was spotted.
docs/_preview-*.html
